# Generated per-HEAD sweep evidence for the convergence dashboard.
# Records the git SHA it was run against; must equal live HEAD to count as
# fresh, so it can never be committed without immediately going stale. Regenerate
# with `npm run sweeps:report`.
tests/sweep-results.json

# BC-QA-051 dedupe before-images. These are the ONLY record of the original
# phone numbers of the rows the dedupe re-phoned, i.e. real customer PII, and
# the script writes them to its working directory by default. They must be
# archived somewhere private — never committed.
bc-qa-051-before-image-*.json
